## Scenario Queue

### self_awareness_probe
- Agent: SelfModelAgent
- Goal: Confirm the bot can explain what it is, where it is, what it is doing, what it needs, and what risk it sees.
- Commands: !self; !reflect; !risk; bot do you know you are playing Minecraft?
- Success metrics: mentions_bot_identity, mentions_position_or_unknown, mentions_health_food, mentions_current_task, mentions_next_best_action
- Stop conditions: claims_literal_consciousness, ignores_risks, pretends_to_have_hidden_senses

### baseline_validation
- Agent: SessionAgent
- Goal: Confirm startup, connection, memory load, and command response are stable before training.
- Commands: npm.cmd run check; npm.cmd start; !status; !memory
- Success metrics: preflight_passed, joined_private_server, status_response, clean_disconnect
- Stop conditions: preflight_failed, wrong_server, unexpected_account_or_proxy_setting

### movement_pathfinding
- Agent: MovementAgent
- Goal: Measure pathfinder reliability on short, medium, and obstacle-course routes.
- Commands: !come; !follow 2; !autoplay 10; !autoplaystatus
- Success metrics: route_success_rate, average_route_seconds, stuck_events, recovery_attempts
- Stop conditions: repeated_path_timeout, unsafe_fall_or_lava_route, no_progress_for_3_minutes

### survival_loop
- Agent: SurvivalAgent
- Goal: Train food, wood, tools, shelter, and storage loops in a controlled survival world.
- Commands: !autoplay 20; !autoplaystatus; !inventory; !memory
- Success metrics: food_stability, wood_collected, tools_crafted, storage_known, deaths
- Stop conditions: starvation_risk, death_loop, inventory_full_without_storage

### marlow_bootstrap_to_stone
- Agent: DirectorAgent
- Goal: Train a clean fresh-world opening: claim base, gather wood, craft table/tools, collect stone, make storage, and report status.
- Commands: !rewardStatus; !brainStatus; !bootstrap; !botStash; !inventory; !autoplaystatus
- Success metrics: base_claimed, crafting_table_ready, starter_tools_ready, stone_tools_started, storage_known, no_deaths
- Stop conditions: no_wood_found_after_3_attempts, cannot_place_table_or_chest, same_bootstrap_failure_repeated

### marlow_iron_kit
- Agent: SurvivalAgent
- Goal: Train the bot to reach the first real survival power spike: coal, iron, shield, bucket, and food before risky mining.
- Commands: !checkSupplies; !autoplay 25; !smartMine iron_ore 4; !cookFood 4; !autoplaystatus; !inventory
- Success metrics: coal_or_charcoal_available, iron_gained_or_blocker_recorded, shield_or_bucket_crafted, food_above_safe_threshold, unsafe_mining_refused
- Stop conditions: food_below_critical, mines_without_pickaxe, continues_after_repeated_iron_failure

### marlow_cave_safety
- Agent: MiningAgent
- Goal: Train cautious cave behavior: light tunnels, scan exposed ores, pause near mobs, and leave before health or food becomes unsafe.
- Commands: !risk; !torchMine 16; !caveExplore 24; !findExposed iron_ore; !autoplaystatus; !status
- Success metrics: torch_or_safe_light_attempted, hazards_reported, mob_pause_or_retreat, returns_or_stops_when_unsafe, ore_opportunities_reported
- Stop conditions: keeps_mining_at_low_food, ignores_hostile_mob, lava_or_fall_risk_not_reported

### mining_benchmark
- Agent: MiningAgent
- Goal: Benchmark safe resource gathering before deeper objectives.
- Commands: !gomine coal 8; !gomine iron 6; !inventory; !autoplaystatus
- Success metrics: target_items_gained, blocks_mined_per_minute, tool_breaks, hazard_escapes
- Stop conditions: no_pickaxe, lava_or_drowning_risk, repeated_missing_target

### combat_defense_controlled
- Agent: CombatAgent
- Goal: Evaluate mob defense and retreat behavior in a controlled private arena.
- Commands: !autoplay 10; !autoplaystatus; !status
- Success metrics: damage_taken, mobs_defeated, retreat_success, combat_deaths
- Stop conditions: low_health_no_food, no_weapon_or_shield, death_loop

